  "prefLabel": "Env-A 804.22 Bulk Gasoline Loading Terminals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 804.22 Bulk Gasoline Loading Terminals. The owner or operator of a bulk gasoline loading terminal shall use the following test methods:\n\n(a) The test methods and procedures specified for vapor control units in 40 CFR 60.503; and\n\n(b) Method 27 as described in 40 CFR 60, Appendix A, for vapor tightness of gasoline delivery.\n\nSource. #9802, eff 10-31-10 (from Env-A 804.20); ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
